    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "new communities feel like such a lie though. it's just starting over from zero with strangers who don't know the real me. it's exhausting to keep trying to \"rebuild\" when everything i actually cared about is dead. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, empty shell around for no reason. i just don't see the point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken beyond repair.",
